  "reviewNotes": "PDF page7; native front/back views. Source479970triangles/23998584bytes,max49.837002mm. Native17mm shoulder; centre floor24.727161mm and interior normal squares nx2=.062496,ny2=.285465,nz2=.652033 confirm X boards. Walls atnegativeX andnegativeY: west64+south16=edge80; two measured blockers protect these strips while centre remains clear. Three Z posts including a full7.5mm shared corner volume, explicitly subtracted from both plaster masks. Four beams measured independently by cross-section source rays atalong[-8,-4,0,4,8], z27..48mm. Coredepth front>-11.3/rear<-16.8 includes carved grooves; weighted planar triangle PCA is a cross-check. West beam frames are YZ, south XZ, with distinct origins/directions/transverse widths and .2mm contact margin. Full front depth[-13.4,-10.25],rear[-17.55,-14] retains wooden flanks. Plaster roughness.98 versuswood.88. No light or decor items. Review each beam and both panels from inside/outside in render/LOD, full alpha framing, placement and actual-sized UV before selecting textures. Initial outer beam mask missed shallow upper wooden flanges: source depth rays atalong0 show rear faces atdepth-16.50/-16.52,z35..36mm, while deep core lies-17.26 at30..33mm. Include reardepth<-16.3 in interval measurement. New exterior widths are about8mm normal to axis, withcentres32.91/32.895mm anddirectionswest[0,.850378,.526172],south[.852517,0,.522699]. Replace both rear projections; retain separate interior5.7mm widths. Inspect all four complete faces before publication.",
